{"format":{"$defs":{"TextReading":{"oneOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"corrected_text":{"maxLength":6000,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"coverage":{"const":"complete"},"paragraph_alias":{"enum":["P1"],"pattern":"^P([1-9]|[12][0-9]|3[0-2])$","title":"Paragraph Alias","type":"string"},"reason":{"type":"null"}},"required":["paragraph_alias","coverage","corrected_text","reason"],"title":"TextReading","type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"corrected_text":{"type":"null"},"coverage":{"const":"incomplete"},"paragraph_alias":{"enum":["P1"],"pattern":"^P([1-9]|[12][0-9]|3[0-2])$","title":"Paragraph Alias","type":"string"},"reason":{"maxLength":1000,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["paragraph_alias","coverage","corrected_text","reason"],"title":"TextReading","type":"object"}]}},"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"contract":{"const":"ocr-productive-repair-text-reply-v3","title":"Contract","type":"string"},"readings":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/TextReading"},"maxItems":1,"minItems":1,"title":"Readings","type":"array"},"unit_id":{"const":"S2"}},"required":["contract","unit_id","readings"],"title":"TextReply","type":"object"},"messages":[{"content":"Inspect the complete assigned target paragraphs against the registered image, including all numbers, names, genuine hyphens, unflagged words and apparent software successes. Flags are inspection hints, not verified errors. Static text is the guarded software proposal, not truth. Return one full corrected text per target, preserving supported historical writing and literal bracket passages. Never return just a flagged word or context paragraph. Supply no offsets or edit lists. If any target cannot be completely read or remains uncertain, return null text, incomplete coverage and a concrete reason. Return the text-reply-v3 JSON reply using the supplied conformance-v4 schema. No source reading is accepted by this reply. For a complete reading, set coverage to \"complete\", corrected_text to the entire reading, and reason to JSON null (not a string). Do not add a completion comment such as \"No further action required.\" For an incomplete or uncertain reading, set coverage to \"incomplete\", corrected_text to JSON null, and reason to a nonempty explanation. Never provide a complete reading while reporting uncertainty.\n\nSource-specific human feedback evidence-note:progress-comments:3:98dc572b5da3329f8229cb98754378a8d3a7d954ba27742ced074842da9acfd0; source congressionalglo7392unit:716:par_000716_000020; raw SHA-256 d86ad98d001eeca387a37678140fb5691201997390bf1d5bcc50c1b111a38570; image SHA-256 558720d837fb5631d182a3f53cec98f8bc9987d09dcc8d65994b3749c35a5668. Check the exact raw passage 'propei-ty' against the image. The recorded case-specific requested reading is 'property'. Repair all other supported errors in this same assigned target. Preserve genuine punctuation and report uncertainty if the evidence disagrees. A review flag or a dictionary match is not a completed correction.\n\nThe original OCR is substantially similar to the printed target paragraph but may need cleanup. Use it as the starting point; verify repairs against the image rather than transcribing all nearby print. Restore words missed by OCR, including words on another line, only when they belong to the assigned target paragraph and are supported by its image. Do not add a whole neighbouring sentence or paragraph. Only target_regions identify text to return. The full image includes nearby print. All regions use the supplied image_frame pixel dimensions, with origin at top-left and exclusive right/bottom edges. visible_context_spans are context only: never append or prepend their words to a target. Each context excerpt identifies only the stated source span; partial parent visibility does not mean the rest of its paragraph is visible or read. Preserve the assigned target paragraph boundary; if its extent cannot be determined, withhold its reading.","role":"system"},{"content":"{\"boundary_scope_contract\":\"ocr-visible-boundary-scope-v1\",\"context_regions\":[],\"contract\":\"ocr-productive-repair-input-v4\",\"diagnostics\":{\"configuration_sha256\":\"8b329985e7a9c4166244e65599b6da1b65846bd5bf6b1c5f973bd78ea44a16aa\",\"detector_sha256\":\"3be87b8538124368fa443b14e30aad46fcd73ee7d41802642a6de81ca4edcc33\",\"negative_targets\":[],\"signals\":[{\"category\":\"word\",\"flags\":[\"internal_hyphen_damage\",\"unknown_internal_hyphen\",\"unverified_review_candidate\"],\"paragraph_alias\":\"P1\",\"raw_end\":57,\"raw_quote\":\"propei-ty\",\"raw_start\":48,\"route_reason\":\"Inspect the original image; this signal is not a repair or a verified reading.\",\"signal_id\":\"f700ec29fbc497c5a6f860c0b52e6607513c3999037a2554670be3bd34710e66\"},{\"category\":\"other\",\"flags\":[\"required_local_reading:property\",\"human_note:evidence-note:progress-comments:3:98dc572b5da3329f8229cb98754378a8d3a7d954ba27742ced074842da9acfd0\"],\"paragraph_alias\":\"P1\",\"raw_end\":57,\"raw_quote\":\"propei-ty\",\"raw_start\":48,\"route_reason\":\"Inspect the entire target against the image; this is not a verified error.\",\"signal_id\":\"de10b6fa7a5753398ae0ea120274e525bace101f01ce8fe2cf4684e973ebccd3\"},{\"category\":\"word\",\"flags\":[\"name_list_unfamiliar\"],\"paragraph_alias\":\"P1\",\"raw_end\":9,\"raw_quote\":\"BROWN\",\"raw_start\":4,\"route_reason\":\"Inspect the entire target against the image; this is not a verified error.\",\"signal_id\":\"552297ab746b2b981e5cf7c9b93448e0a73bdf34fdabc98603d5161f30005c9f\"},{\"category\":\"word\",\"flags\":[\"post_repair_word_unfamiliar\"],\"paragraph_alias\":\"P1\",\"raw_end\":57,\"raw_quote\":\"propei-ty\",\"raw_start\":48,\"route_reason\":\"Inspect the entire target against the image; this is not a verified error.\",\"signal_id\":\"f98409bcf2630b418c8cce06a1b8d34fbb44fe4b9f33d35086813a01c7488ac4\"}],\"status\":\"frozen\"},\"image_alias\":\"I1\",\"image_frame\":{\"coordinates\":\"pixels; origin top-left; right/bottom exclusive\",\"height\":212,\"width\":1004},\"paragraphs\":[{\"paragraph_alias\":\"P1\",\"raw_text\":\"Mr. BROWN. The navigable channel is not private propei-ty.\",\"role\":\"target\",\"static_edits\":[],\"static_text\":\"Mr. BROWN. The navigable channel is not private propei-ty.\"}],\"reply_contract\":\"ocr-productive-repair-text-reply-v3\",\"role\":\"productive_repair_and_self_check\",\"saved_proposal\":null,\"target_regions\":[{\"crop_region\":{\"bottom\":148,\"left\":64,\"right\":940,\"top\":64},\"paragraph_alias\":\"P1\"}],\"unit_id\":\"S2\",\"visible_context_spans\":[{\"crop_region\":{\"bottom\":62,\"left\":65,\"right\":146,\"top\":27},\"line_id\":\"line_000716_000100\",\"paragraph_sha256\":\"d6816bbb3e176be1e0c2ec5e00d517b70a6b446b8e72d6fd27ee77b3d25d7af7\",\"parent_visibility\":\"partial\",\"raw_end\":96,\"raw_start\":91,\"source_id\":\"congressionalglo7392unit:716:par_000716_000019\",\"text\":\"erty.\",\"text_sha256\":\"e425f85644b63d29d41090d5e337a2cf7ae904188439c7176d90e8165bd12227\"}]}","images":[""],"role":"user"}],"model":"qwen3.8:27b-mlx","options":{"num_predict":1500},"stream":false,"think":false}